sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Admin
  participant C as React client
  participant A as Express API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  U->>C: Admin tab: email and password
  C->>A: POST /api/auth/login
  A->>D: SELECT user WHERE lower(email) = lower(…)
  D-->>A: user row
  A->>A: bcrypt.compare(password, hash)
  alt Wrong email or password
    A-->>C: 401 Invalid email or password
    C-->>U: Show error
  else Correct
    A->>A: Sign JWT {id, role, actorType: admin}
    A-->>C: 200 user and token
    C->>C: Store token
    C-->>U: Dashboard with every module
  end
